  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">School for the Common Good: Productive Actions for Sustainable Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iniciativas para el Desarrollo de una Economa Alternativa y Solidaria A.C. (Ideas Comunitarias)will reach more than 240 young indigenous leaders in several communities of Oaxaca with its curriculum that trains them to undertake community development and projects for generating income. Students will be eligible for subgrants to fund their proposals.</narrative>
  </description>
